{"generated": "2026-08-10 17:05", "brief": "<b>1. 메리츠증권의 자본시장 존재감 확대</b>\n메리츠증권은 포스코가 추진하는 2.5조 원 규모의 주식리쿼디티선도거래(PRS) 딜에 깜짝 참여하며 대형 IB로서의 위상을 드러냈습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQTS04djVSRG54azFaQTZZVnViZlRWcG91eC1tMDZJUVBWSzdMdFIwbmVPVlpPZF9naGE2OWtDUnZaSDZHSlpNZy04bWlYcmpSN2k4cS16d1JJNGhtZ2pFZGc1OEJGdElpRGR4SHZlWEdUdjJjMnQ0elRGdEp2RGxJMWZkSE0tVWZkaXAw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#7</a>]. 또한, 기획재정부의 세계국채지수(WGBI) 편입에 기여한 핵심 인사를 영입하며 대외 역량과 자본시장 경쟁력을 한층 강화하고 나섰습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPNmxsZG1WdXMtYTd3X0UzMHZkbzNHNVkwYXFJanYyZmdGTnlwVDVmNzdmT0RTUm5EaktvejZvUGVtVVpEMGdIbkhfREVnRjRxaDA1OVpKRlNybEhtdk4ySjg1NU94dGtEbTlwWmVCSHhZRUx1VDBMYVhBTkR1T2oyQ3NQaHNLOHpodk9v?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#6</a>].\n\n<b>2. KDB생명 인수전의 새로운 국면</b>\nKDB생명 매각(M&amp;A) 시장에서 흥국금융그룹이 인수 경쟁의 우위를 점하기 시작한 가운데, 한국투자금융지주와 한화그룹의 셈법이 복잡해지고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPMkFxMk9wQXBBWl9VMFpoNy1wNldhY0labDJ5RmJ2MlFkaHV4N2xOc3dacmw2NVNBY3U1WUZ0alZQemNZaHkzemVRb3NRTVItZEFXRXpFVGpyckl0anBfNENNZTM5MjVUcDk2alhKbUM0QnF6emNyNHR0VDlzZnN6aURRZmppMUlLWk9v?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#10</a>]. 수차례 매각이 무산되었던 KDB생명이 이번에는 새로운 주인을 찾아 딜을 완주할 수 있을지 업계의 이목이 쏠립니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPMkFxMk9wQXBBWl9VMFpoNy1wNldhY0labDJ5RmJ2MlFkaHV4N2xOc3dacmw2NVNBY3U1WUZ0alZQemNZaHkzemVRb3NRTVItZEFXRXpFVGpyckl0anBfNENNZTM5MjVUcDk2alhKbUM0QnF6emNyNHR0VDlzZnN6aURRZmppMUlLWk9v?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#10</a>].\n\n<b>3. 아모레퍼시픽 오너 3세의 지분 매각</b>\n아모레퍼시픽그룹 서경배 회장의 차녀인 서호정 씨가 보유 중인 그룹 지분 중 약 78억 원 규모를 장내 매각했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxObmxEaW8zYjMtZlU4VXUydGRzellBcnBpdjFQX044WlJaU05lcjF5OU85YWF4ckF4N2EySDlxUExlNmMwTUFiUURvOUR5ek5Sa3psQlhmdWhidV9kcEZ0Ql9jSjNJSmE5RG1tOTE2YWt5QTk1SThXVmJEQi1SeTJGckM3VFJDeFZVaXR3?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#8</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE9Wc3ItRjM1ZFNodlI0U3RBV1dibXBQNDB0ei1XVl9KMzRIVDZVeHBJaWZYUVM2Mkk0MEJUcFpKTXc4NWlxZl9HLTRlcEh2cUxseHVJ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a>]. 이번 지분 매각은 아모레퍼시픽 오너가 3세의 승계 재원 마련 또는 개인 자금 확보 차원으로 풀이됩니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxObmxEaW8zYjMtZlU4VXUydGRzellBcnBpdjFQX044WlJaU05lcjF5OU85YWF4ckF4N2EySDlxUExlNmMwTUFiUURvOUR5ek5Sa3psQlhmdWhidV9kcEZ0Ql9jSjNJSmE5RG1tOTE2YWt5QTk1SThXVmJEQi1SeTJGckM3VFJDeFZVaXR3?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#8</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE9Wc3ItRjM1ZFNodlI0U3RBV1dibXBQNDB0ei1XVl9KMzRIVDZVeHBJaWZYUVM2Mkk0MEJUcFpKTXc4NWlxZl9HLTRlcEh2cUxseHVJ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a>].\n\n<b>4. 클레온, KB증권 손잡고 IPO 본격화</b>\n인공지능(AI) 휴먼 인터페이스 전문 기업 클레온이 KB증권을 상장 주관사이자 투자자로 맞이하며 코스닥 시장 상장 준비에 본격적으로 돌입했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBIdUViSVpTeEdadGdzOUp3MG1ldHk2NGRIbS1LY3ExcjZsNXZsa1hPRkhRa0d0ZTFjT1ZKUFRTMWJ5YnV3dU4xeA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE1sTFNhU0NmUmlNenZ2ZktUcnNLV2VYTDJKZ1BTekRrU1BFcGxqc3RnR2VPNVV1Z09tYVJtbGdoTHBEdUFNbnFjdGV5Q08wb3JfWm5xaV8tZHFobHFOZFVxZzNB?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9pX014ZjdOdThMMlRGTEFkbTlsX1NwbUlDTTNYTjFBeWIyTnVaWlJpMGpqUXFKVWlmcGt3WENLaFhmcV8zNVdjY0ExODlHS0t1Ty1tcFo4c3pWUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#31</a>]. KB증권의 직접 투자와 주관 하에 기술특례상장 등을 통한 증시 입성을 추진할 계획입니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBIdUViSVpTeEdadGdzOUp3MG1ldHk2NGRIbS1LY3ExcjZsNXZsa1hPRkhRa0d0ZTFjT1ZKUFRTMWJ5YnV3dU4xeA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9pX014ZjdOdThMMlRGTEFkbTlsX1NwbUlDTTNYTjFBeWIyTnVaWlJpMGpqUXFKVWlmcGt3WENLaFhmcV8zNVdjY0ExODlHS0t1Ty1tcFo4c3pWUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#31</a>].", "b